  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Media Capacity for Media Sector Reform in Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The overall objective&lt;/strong&gt; is to contribute to implementation of Media Strategy and accompanying Action Plan in line with EU standards by strengthening overall capacity and influence of the established.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The specific objectives are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO 1:&lt;/strong&gt; To further strengthen representative potential and influence of Media Consortium for advancing media reform;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO 2:&lt;/strong&gt; To increase internal capacity of media to adhere to ethical standards of the profession.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
